# Not in CI: the control for ADR-014's limits. A 10 MB Rust file with highlighting forced on
# (Highlight Anyway) stalls frames while GtkSourceView analyses it; large.stet-test types into
# the same file with the default policy. The step is expected to fail; read the numbers.
# Run: tools/headless.sh 30 target/release/stet --self-test tests/selftest/perf-typing-control.stet-test

unpace-frames
write-generated $TMP/ten.rs rust 10485760
open ten.rs
assert-highlight false
cursor 20 1
type-burst 30 100 100
banner-click "Highlight Anyway"
assert-highlight true
type-burst 30 100 100
